(7731891, 1273856, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i> It''s a fine drone shot but it doesn''t really speak to the challenge, IMO anyway. It''s like I took a photograph of a tree and titled it "Leafs", expecting that to fly because some of them have turned color... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I thought the same thing, but it is very artfully done.</td>', 'Originally posted by Bear_Music: It''s a fine drone shot but it doesn''t really speak to the challenge, IMO anyway. It''s like I took a photograph of a tree and titled it "Leafs", expecting that to fly because some of them have turned color...   I thought the same thing, but it is very artfully done.', '2022-11-02 00:42:49.000000', NULL, 0),
