(7731900, 1273856, 83313, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i> It''s a fine drone shot but it doesn''t really speak to the challenge, IMO anyway. It''s like I took a photograph of a tree and titled it "Leafs", expecting that to fly because some of them have turned color... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I thought the same thing, but it is very artfully done. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>It <i>did</i> occur to me, but I have learned after 15 years on DPC, that a strong image counts for more than nailing the topic to everyone''s satisfaction. See my post in the outtakes thread for a view that I think nailed the topic more dead-on.</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Originally posted by Bear_Music: It''s a fine drone shot but it doesn''t really speak to the challenge, IMO anyway. It''s like I took a photograph of a tree and titled it "Leafs", expecting that to fly because some of them have turned color...   I thought the same thing, but it is very artfully done.  It did occur to me, but I have learned after 15 years on DPC, that a strong image counts for more than nailing the topic to everyone''s satisfaction. See my post in the outtakes thread for a view that I think nailed the topic more dead-on.', '2022-11-02 01:30:27.000000', NULL, 0),
