(7731911, 1273856, 242379, '<td valign="top">I voted 10 because I really like this picture. Previously I took into account how well the photo fulfilled the challenge and gave less points if it didn´t. But I noticed that it wasn´t visible in the results, so I mainly choose based on the image quality. Congratulations on zour ribbon!</td>', 'I voted 10 because I really like this picture. Previously I took into account how well the photo fulfilled the challenge and gave less points if it didn´t. But I noticed that it wasn´t visible in the results, so I mainly choose based on the image quality. Congratulations on zour ribbon!', '2022-11-02 09:42:02.000000', NULL, 0),
