(7731919, 1273856, 141319, '<td valign="top">Congrats, another lovely drone image - so well composed.<br/>I am surprised people don''t immediately see the challenge in this - I do. All the "little white boats" look "similar" lying in their dock, but they are not the same if you take a closer look (some are obviously not the same). <br/>Or you could look at the actual bays - the arrangement and numbers are the same, but since all have a different number of boats in them, they are only "similar, not the same".<br/>Anyway, IMO a great entry, congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Congrats, another lovely drone image - so well composed.I am surprised people don''t immediately see the challenge in this - I do. All the "little white boats" look "similar" lying in their dock, but they are not the same if you take a closer look (some are obviously not the same). Or you could look at the actual bays - the arrangement and numbers are the same, but since all have a different number of boats in them, they are only "similar, not the same".Anyway, IMO a great entry, congrats on the ribbon.', '2022-11-02 10:22:48.000000', NULL, 0),
